  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Division funding to the African Agriculture Development Company (AgDevCo)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AgDevCo is a specialised investor and project developer focused exclusively on early stage Small and Medium Enterprise agribusiness in Sub Saharan Africa. AgDevCo deploys patient capital and technical assistance to build profitable businesses that contribute to food security, drive economic growth and create jobs and income in rural areas and contribute to farmers&#x2019; resilience to climate change. AgDevCo currently operates in Sierra Leone, Ghana, Cote D&apos;Ivoire, Rwanda, Kenya, Malawi, Mozambique, Tanzania, Uganda, Zambia.</narrative>
  </description>
